IY: The switching analysis shows RIY of 0.4% [P14], which is the annual yield required from the existing scheme to match the projected retirement value of the recommended scheme. This is significantly lower than the claimed cost savings of 0.76% to 0.98%, which suggests either the growth assumptions used in the projection are conservative, or the cost benefit is smaller than claimed. The report does not reconcile the RIY outcome with the cost-savings claims.","citations":[{"passageId":"P1","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"We have negotiated a reduced platform charges of 0.19%, compared to the Quilter charges of 0.27%, representing a savings of £208 per annum, based on the estimated fund value.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"The platform charges with Aviva are 0.21% compared to the True Potential platform charges of 0.40%, this represents a saving of 0.19% or £88.68 based on the current value of the fund.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"The ongoing fund charges are higher in the existing contract at 0.58% compared with 0.20% within the new plan, representing an annual saving of £177.35 based on the current value of the pension","cells":null},{"passageId":"P12","source":"Annes M SAP IAC only ex existing OAC  24.3.26.md","category":"G","quote":null,"cells":["True Potential Personal Pension","£46,672.80","£46,672.80"]},{"passageId":"P11","source":"Annes M SAP All charges ex existing OAC  24.3.26.md","category":"G","quote":null,"cells":["Weighted Average","0.0000%","0.2154%"]},{"passageId":"P14","source":"Annes M SAP no charges ex existing OAC  24.3.26.md","category":"G","quote":null,"cells":["Aviva","Pension Portfolio (Choice)","0.4%"]},{"passageId":"P3","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"The