#### How to compare
Method: SetCoverage
Tolerance: Each dimension the report compares must be supported by provider or research documentation.
- Guard: Provider fund-range and option data changes over time; check the date of the research before treating a difference as an error.
- Guard: Where the existing scheme is better on a dimension, the report must say so — a one-sided comparison is a finding in itself.
